  "text": "Christopher Columbus.\n\nIt is truly inspiring to see the explorer's commitment to 'innovation' by repackaging the same planet with a new name and increasing the price of existence. One must admire the audacity and sheer creativity involved in convincing the indigenous populations that what they really needed was essentially the same geography they already had, but with a sleek adjective added to its name: \"The New World.\""
